<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- Ibaas</book>
  <para style="h">1 BaKorinti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1BaK</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 BaKorinti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kufumung imɛsɛng fɛ́ aBulus Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aKorinti</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 BaKorinti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kufumung imɛsɛng fɛ́ aBulus <optbreak /> Jɛk sak na bafi ikuus na aKorinti</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Kufumung kang ne ni imi aBulus, ayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom di kasa ni ishim wu nin sot atom aYeso Kristi, nɛ aruneng yit aSostenes.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />Sak na bafi ikuus Adakunom fɛ́ ba se na aKorinti, bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba te jɛrɛ ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso, ba mi ka ba yes nek kusot aJɛrɛ, ngma nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba yes iyerek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi kaakyɛ, tɛ aTisa bá nɛ afiit.<verse eid="1CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Won itek ni kukyang fi ku nes na Ada yit Adakunom nɛ aTisa aYeso Kristi ni ku sot kufiin.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inesek ifeng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />In nesek Adakunom ifeng kaakyi izen nek itek wu fɛ́ a ki nesek yin ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Nek kusot yin ayɛt wu, i mi te yin barum na kaakyi irèn, ayɛt icɛɛt ni irērēn nkyɔrɔk. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Nek ikyɛng fi in cɛɛt yit naton Anet-Isheshek mi shining nek iyin. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Nek anɔng, vit kunang abik fi ku se vit ni yin, ni tsin tang yin ayisi itot yin kubɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />Iwu da ki bereng yin gakgak sak ni igang e, nɔng i bi se yin vit inɛn atuk ibɛ́ aTisa yit aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Adakunom fɛ́ a ki yes yin ayɛt kusot ifiri ne Arim wu aYeso Kristi aTisa yit, yet afi ishining ifɛ̀.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ikaba nate bafi ikuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Ábaruneng, in tsin ra won ni yin ayɛt iyerek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi fok, won ngma yin ni sot yin bazining, kɔng ikaba bi se nate yin, nɔng i da sot yin ayɛt imoon ice gyatgyat, ni foos yin ni yiring yin ikyɛng izining. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Ábaruneng, bafɛ́ ari aKolowe mi di tak fok, ifa mi nɔ nate yin. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" />Ikyɛng de fi in di cɛɛt; akak nye, &lt;&lt;Imi kuus aBulus&gt;&gt;, nɛ akak nye, &lt;&lt;Imi kuus Apolos&gt;&gt;, nɛ akak nye, &lt;&lt;Imi kuus aKefas&gt;&gt;, nɛ akak nye bà, &lt;&lt;Imi kuus Anet-Isheshek.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Ba kaba Anet-Isheshek yɛ? Ba kin tekak aBulus nek iyin ɛ? Kɛ ba kin ki ra yin abatisma ni iyerek aBulus ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />In bi ifeng nek imi ra akak yin abatisma awo, tit aKirispus nɛ aGayus kyɛk, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" />nek anɔng, vit akak yin fɛ́ a da fɛ̀ fok ba kin ku ra abatisma ni iyerek hom. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" />(Ey! In kin ti in ra bafɛ́ ari aIstifanus abatisma bà, ama anɔng, in da kyem in ti yiring ke in mang ra akak abatisma awo.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Nek da Anet-Isheshek di tom ni imɛsɛng nek iras abatisma kyɛk awo, igbat e yet ni ishara ifɛ̀ itek, da ni kutsitsɛng banet awe awo, kɔng itekak Anet-Isheshek bi sot vit agap.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anet-Isheshek yet kutsitsɛng nɛ agap Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Ifɛ̀ itekak Anet-Isheshek yet ifɛ̀ abap sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba tsin wɛɛs, awɛt sak ni yit fɛ́ ba tsin ki sheshek yit, iyet agap Adakunom. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" />Nek i se ni jɛk ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">&lt;&lt;In da beseng kutsitsɛng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">bafi kutsitsɛng;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">In da nyɔrɔk irēn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">bafi irēn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />Afi kutsitsɛng e se kyɛ? Agwɔm irēn e se kyɛ? Bágwɔm irērēn nkyɔrɔk ayɛ nang e se kyɛ? Adakunom mi te kutsitsɛng azatse sot ishɔp awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Nek ayɛt kutsitsɛng Adakunom, a di fok da kazatse da kyem ka ku rēn ni ikyɛng fɛ́ ka yes kutsitsɛng awo, nek anɔng, Adakunom ayɛt ite iyɛ wu, a sheshek ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba nɔɔk atsak, ngma ni kucɛɛt fɛ́ ba nye fok, &lt;&lt;Ishara ifɛ̀ me yet kucɛɛt abap.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />BaYahuda tsɛsɛk ntomong abes, nɛ BaGirik tsɛsɛk kutsitsɛng, <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />awɛt iyit, shara yit ifɛ̀ itekak Anet-Isheshek ni kum; ifɛ́ fi i yet ikyɛng itu atak na baYahuda, i yet kucɛɛt abap na BaGirik, i yet agap ni kutsitsɛng Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Awɛt bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi ka ba yes, kɛ na ba yet baYahuda, kɛ bafɛ́ BaGirik ayi, ifɛ̀ me yet Anet-Isheshek, iwu wu a yet ízɔk ni kutsitsɛng Adakunom. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Nek ishɔp Adakunom wat ikyɛng fɛ́ banet yes fok kutsitsɛng, ni kugbɛrɛk Adakunom wat ikyɛng fɛ́ banet yes fok agap.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Ábaruneng, yiring yin kuri banet fi i kin yet yin ni izen fɛ́ Adakunom kin ki yes yin. Batsitsɛng kin se dot ayɛt yin ni imaas banet awo; bafi itak ni ifok kin se dot awo; nnon barum kin se dot awo. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Awɛt Adakunom kasa ashɔbɔsh nkyɔrɔk azatse nɔng a di te batsitsɛng nsum; Adakunom kasa nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ kazatse fɛ́ in se vit agap, nɔng a di te bafɛ́ agap nsum. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Adakunom kasa nkyɔrɔk kazatse fi in dung rat, fɛ́ ba byɛs ina, fok da in kyem ikyikak awo, a di ra kutomong, nɔng a di buruk kuyiring banet, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />kɔn anet akak bi tsot kugwɔm nanu ashon wu. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Ayet nek Adakunom wu fi iyin di se yin ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso, iwu fɛ́ a mi ki sot yit kutsitsɛng fi ku ne na Adakunom, ayɛt wu in mi sot yit tabat, in mi te yit Jɛrɛ, ba mi ki bisik yit washak ashon Adakunom. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" />Nek anɔng, i se ni jɛk ye, &lt;&lt;Won ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a da nye kukaa, na a nye iko ayɛt aTisa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Ábaruneng, izen fi in kin bɛ́ ishara ifɛ̀ azɔng ni yin, in kin bɛ́ ni itang anu ke ni kutsitsɛng kukak fi in kin ki taas yin mo ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom nye fi i se ni nɛt awo. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Nek in rosom fok nkum kusot hom nate yin, in da shim in rēn ikyikak awo, tit kucɛɛt naton aYeso Kristi ni itekak wu. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" />Imi kin bɛ́ ni yin gbɛrɛk ni nnyim, ni itiim irɔm. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Itom hom ni ishara ifɛ̀ hom kin se ni irèn kutsitsɛng ni ikɔk nhwyɛ awo, tit i kin se ni itonoso agap kutomong abik, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />kɔn ishan atsak yin bi sot naton kutsitsɛng banet awo, tit ni kukyem Adakunom.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutsitsɛng na Abik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Ngma ne anɔng, in cɛɛt yit kucɛɛt kutsitsɛng sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi kyem, awɛt kutsitsɛng e yet kufi ayɛ nang ke kufɛ́ bágwɔm ayɛ nang fi kurat bà mi bɛ́ awo. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Awey yo, iyit cɛɛt yit naton kutsitsɛng Adakunom fi ku se ni nɛt, kutsitsɛng fɛ́ ba kin nɛt iko, kuyɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mang sak gyam dang na ba nye kazatse nek ízɔk yit. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Vit akak ayɛt bágwɔm ayɛ nang kyem a rēn iko, nek ba kin fɛ́ ba rēn, ke ba kin tekak aTisa ízɔk awo. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" />Ngma na anɔng, i se ni jɛk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">&lt;&lt;Vit ayisi fɛ́ a ki mang di,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">vit kuto fi ku ki mang fok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">vit iyɛ fi i ki mang yiring,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom mang nye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">nek bayɔng fɛ́ ba kushim.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Awɛt Adakunom mi ki tonong yit ina ayɛt abik wu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 2:10">Nek Kabik tsɛsɛk kaakyɛ, ngma nkyɔrɔk Adakunom fi in se tsik-tsik. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Nek akyɛ anet fɛ́ a rēn kuyiring anet akak ɛ tit kabik fɛ́ ka se ayɛt anet e awɛ? Kpaf anɔng, vit anet fɛ́ a rēn kuyiring Adakunom tit Kabik Adakunom e. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Iyit shan yit kabik azatse awo, tit Kabik fɛ́ a ne na Adakunom, nɔng in di ki rēn yit ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom nɔɔk ni mbɔk washak. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Ikyɛng deng fi in di cɛɛt yit naton e, da ni ncɛɛt fɛ́ banet ki tees yit awo tit ncɛɛt fɛ́ Kabik ki tees yit, in cɛɛt yit atsak abik sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se na abik. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Anet fɛ́ a se vit Kabik, a shashang nkyɔrɔk fi in nes na Kabik Adakunom awo, nek in yet nkyɔrɔk abap ni wu, ama anɔng, da a kyɛm a rēn ina awo, nek a yɛrɛ ina na ayisi abik. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Awɛt anet fɛ́ a se na abik, a tsɛɛm kaakyi ikyɛng, awɛt iwu ice wu, a se nawop ishɔk akak awo,<verse eid="1CO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" />&lt;&lt;Angan wu a ki mang rēn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">kuyiring aTisa yɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">Angan da kyɛm a ku tees ɛ?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Awɛt iyit, bɛ́ yit kuyiring Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Ikaba nate bafi Ikuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Ábaruneng, in da kyɛm in cɛɛt ni yin tɛ bafɛ́ abik awo, tit bafɛ́ azatse, naban nnon ni kuus Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" />In ki nɔk yin nabasang, da nayak agap awo, nek i kin tsang kyɛm yin iya me awo, katsak e, sak atut ana, i mi kyem yin iya me awo. <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />Iyin ren resek yin mo bafɛ́ azatse, nek ifup ni ifà se nate yin, nggɔn azatse yɔng itonoso yin nɔng awɛ? Iyin nye yin tɛ banet azatse yɔng awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" />Nek ke akak fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Imi kuus aBulus&gt;&gt;, na akak fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Imi kuus Apolos&gt;&gt;, idɔng tonong fok, i tsin nye yin nggɔn banet awe yɔng awɛ?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Akyɛ me yet Apolos ɛ? Akyɛ yet aBulus ɛ? In nye ba yet basam kyɛk awɛ, ni ntomong bà wu fi iyin sɛ yin i di nɔk yin atsak, kaangan ba bɛ́ kutomong fɛ́ aTisa ku nɔk ira me. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" />Imi tuus ica me, Apolos di tes ashi, awɛt Adakunom wu a sak ide i rasak. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Nek anɔng, da anet ituus e kɛ anet ites ashi me fɛ́ ba yet ikyikak awo, tit Adakunom fɛ́ a sas nkyɔrɔk rasak. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Anet fɛ́ a tuus nɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a di tes ashi, ite iyɛ bá yet izining, kaangan ba bi shan izang wu kpaf ni kutomong wu. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Nek iyit yet yit bafi ifiri ni tomong nɛ Adakunom, iyin yet yin ikɔ Adakunom, ni inok Adakunom.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Ni itek fɛ́ Adakunom mi di nɔk, in ta itis e tɛ agwɔm inok, akak tsin di nok naton e. Awɛt kaangan na nye yɛɛt kuri inok fɛ́ a se ne. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Nek vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da tɛ a ta itis ikak zɛɛt ni idɔng fɛ ba mi tsang ta, fi i yet aYeso Kristi. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Ke akak di nok ni itis e deng ne ata asɛng kɛ ata akan kɛ ata itsɔm kɛ ne akon, kɛ ne agam kɛ ne atangyɔt ayi, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />ba bi di kutomong wu akaangan, nek atuk e yɔng bi tonong iko wɛshɛk. Nek ba bi tonong kutomong akaangan ni kurong, kurong e bi mara agap kutomong akaangan. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Ki ikyɛng fɛ́ a nok di nak de, a da shan izang wu. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ki kurong ya ide, a sot kawɛy ku sɛ; awɛt iwu ice wu ba bi ku sheshek, tit isheshek e bi se tɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a hwyet ayɛt abelem árong.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />Iyin rēn yin fok, iyin ice yin yet yin karɔ iya Adakunom ntong awɛ? I rēn yin fok Kabik Adakunom sosok ayɛt yin awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a beseng karɔ iya Adakunom ntong, Adakunom da ku beseng; nek karɔ iya Adakunom ntong se jɛrɛ, iyin ba i yet yin karɔ iya Adakunom ntong e.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />I bi wɔrɔk yin ice yin awo. Ke akak ayɛt yin di fok, iwu yet atsitsɛng iyɛrɛ ifɛ́ azatse kang, won na a sot ishɔp nɔng a bin sot atsitsɛng. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" />Nek kutsitsɛng azatse kang yet ishɔp nanu ashon Adakunom. Kyɔn ti fi di se ni jɛk ye: &lt;&lt;Adakunom yisik batsitsɛng ne agunung kutsitsɛng bá,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" />i ti se ni jɛk ye, &lt;&lt;ATisa rēn fok, kuyiring batsitsɛng yet abap.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Nek anɔng, itsot kugwɔm ne banet mi gang! Nek kaakyɛ yet ifiin, <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Ke na yet aBulus a, kɛ Apolos, kɛ aKefas, kɛ kazatse, kɛ kutset, kɛ iku, kɛ yɔkɔnɔng kɛ sak ashon ayi, ngma in yet ifiin, <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />ni iyin yet yin bafɛ́ Anet-Isheshek, Anet-Isheshek yet afɛ́ Adakunom.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Batom Anet-Isheshek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Nek anɔng, i se gyat banet ki sok yit, tɛ bafi kutomong Anet-Isheshek, tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom mi ka ba nɔk itot nkyɔrɔk Adakunom fi in kin se ni nɛt. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Ikyɛng fɛ́ ba shim bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ka ba nɔk itot nkyɔrɔk e nang, na ba sot banet atsak. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Awɛt a di yet imi ikyikak awo ki iyin di tsɛt yin ishɔt kyɔn tɛ bafi ishɔt azatse di ras, imi da ra ice hom ishɔt awo. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Nek kuyiring in se halal, ngma na anɔng, i sot fok in se dun inɛn awo. ATisa wu a yet agwɔm ishɔt in. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Nek anɔng, i bi tsɛɛt yin ikikak ishɔt ni izen e resek awo; tot yin ma aTisa a bɛ́s wu ninyen. Iwu wu bi tun wɛshɛk ikyɛng fi ahwyi nɛt, a bi tarak ikyɛng fɛ́ banet nɛsɛk na áyɛ ba. Ni izen e yɔng wu, banet bi sɛs itere bà na Adakunom.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Ábaruneng, in bɛ́ ni kucɛɛt kang naton ice min nɛ Apolos nek iyin, nɔng iyin da sɛ yin ikyɛng imɛɛs ni cɛɛt e, &lt;&lt;I bi shorop yin ikyɛng fi i se ni jɛk awo.&gt;&gt; Kɔng i bi tsot kugwɔm naton akak aza akak. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Angan da te, i wat bakak ɛ? Akyɛ fi bɛ̀, fɛ́ da Adakunom wu a da nɔɔk awɛ? Ki i se anɔng, akyɛ da saas tsot kugwɔm ti kunang fɛ́ ba da nye ne awɛ?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />I di yin ti i mi sɛ yin kaakyɛ! I mi te yin barúm! I mi sot yin bágwɔm akɔn in dang iyit! Ki ifi yet fok i yet yin bágwɔm na atsak e, kin in bin di ya yit igwɔm e ngma! <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Nek a di se imi, tɛ Adakunom mi sak iyit batom-aYeso ni in sot yit bayɔng fɛ́ ba da ne ama, tɛ bayɔng fi ishɔt mi ka ba ya fɛ́ ba da fɛɛs ashon banet. In mi sot yit ikyɛng iyɛrɛ azatse ngma nɛ sak na batomaza ne banet bà. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />In mi sot yit áshɔp nek Anet-Isheshek, awɛt iyin yet yin batsitsɛng ayɛt Anet-Isheshek! Iyit mi te yit gbɛrɛk, awɛt iyin te yin agap! Ba ki nesek yin iyin iratek, awɛt na ba ki byɛs yit iyit!<verse eid="1CO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Sak atut ana, in yɔng in rēn ya yit nzong ni in foos yit iyɛ ingash, in yɔng in rēn tsees yit na agyɛt áres, ba ki foos yit nrɔm ni itosok yit, vit iyit na nasa. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" />In nye nyɛk yit ntomong ni mbɔk yit. Ba ki nyes yit itok, ni iyit ka ba tes awɛng; ba ki nesek yit mgbang, ni in tsesek yit; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />ba ki nyes yit mbɔɔs, ni iyit ka ba bushung yit kucɛɛt yɛlɛl. Sak atut ana, iyit mi sot tɛ karɔ ikorok arik azatse, ikyɛng fɛ́ kazatse byɛn.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Da imi tsin ki jɛk yin nkyɔrɔk nang, nek in ki te yin nsum awo, tit nek in ki kɔrɔk yin kuto, ti icɛk iyɛ ni nnon hom. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Ngma ne banek agup kusɔk fi bɛ̀ yin ni kufiri yin ne Anet-Isheshek, i bɛ̀ yin bada dot awo, ayit kufiri yin ne Anet-Isheshek, imi sot ada yin mok kufiri ne Anet-Isheshek aYeso ni ifɛ̀ itek deng. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" />Nek anɔng wu fi in di fɛ̀ ni iyin, di mɛɛs yin mo. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Nek anɔng wu fi in tsin ki tom yin mo aTimoti, ari hom ayɔng fi in shim makiyi, afɛ́ atsak ayɛt aTisa. Iwu da ki yiring yin mo kuri nse fi in bɛ̀ ni kufiri hom ne Anet-Isheshek aYeso, fi ku se kpaf ni itees fi in tees ngma ni itusung bafi ikuus fi in di tse.<verse eid="1CO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Bakak ayɛt yin kok ice, ti imi bi tin bɛ́ azɔng awo. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Awɛt imi yɔng in bɛ́ bakat ibɛ́, ni kushim aTisa, nɔng in da bin fok ncɛɛt fɛ́ ba cɛɛt, ni kukyem fɛ́ ba bɛ̀. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Nek igwɔm Adakunom yet kudot icɛɛt awo tit kukyem. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Akyɛ fi iyin kasa yin ɛ? In ki bɛ́ yin na ahwyereng a kɛ in ki bɛ̀ yin ni ishim nɛ kabik kayɛlɛl e yɛ?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Nggɔn kujang <optbreak /> beseng kusot bafi Ikuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />Ncɛɛt ma fo pɔk nate yin fok, ba sɛ kujang kuri kuyɔng fɛ́ da bafi nhwyi da kyem ba ra awo: Anet na a sot na abin atek. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Ngma na anɔng, ni di tsot yin kukaa! Ise gyat ke kafa kawe mi ki shining yin awɛ? Ki i wobok yin anet fɛ́ a nye nggɔn yɔng nate yin awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />Ngma ne fi da in se gung ni yin ni rɔm awo, in se ni yin ne abik, imi mi tsɛɛt ishɔt naton anet fɛ́ a nye ikyɛng dɔng ti in se azɔng ni iyin. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Ki i nyim yin ni iyerek aTisa yit aYeso, imi da se gung ni yin ayɛt abik, kukyem aTisa yit aYeso fi ku se ni yin, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />nabak yin anet e yong na aShetan, nɔng ba bin wey ni nse irɔm fi in se ni wu, nɔng kutset wu bi di sɛ isheshek ni kunom fɛ́ aTisa bi bɛ́s wu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" />Kukaa fi i nye yin se gyat awo. Iyin rēn yin fok ka gyebet ayist sak mkpe akpam ngma kusum mos awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" />Tun yin ayist azen afi inɛn yɔng, nɔng i da sot yin akpam afas, ti i di yet yin. Nek ba mi nabak ashosh kitsamang ishorosho yit, Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" />Nek anɔng, won in ya yit kashon ni ne amok aPasova me, dang akpam ayist, fɛ́ a yet ayist anyas nɛ imaan e, tit ni ya yit ne akpam vit ayist, fɛ́ a yet akpam atsak naton atsak.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />In ki jɛk yin e ni kufumung hom fok, ikikak bi ki moon yin ne bafi kujang awo. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Da in tsin cɛɛt naton banet azatse kang fɛ́ ba ras kujang awo, kɛ bafi kuhwye, kɛ bafi imɔɔt banet, kɛ bafi ikuus nabannom awo. Nek idɔng da tonong fok i da won yin kazatse yong. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />Awɛt yɔkɔnɔng in tsin ki jɛk yin ne fok da ikikak bi ki moon yin ne ayɔng fɛ́ a nye fok iwu yet afi ikuus awɛt na ras kujang, ni kuhwye, na ya nabannom ntong, na ras itok, na sɔs kutsit, kɛ na mɔɔt banet ayi. Anet kuri ayɔng, kuyak bi ki moon yin ni wu awo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12" />Akyɛ hom di se ni in ras bayɔng fɛ́ ba se amatse bafi ikuus ishɔt ɛ? Bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ayɛt e ba fi iyin da ka ba ras yin ishɔt awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13" />Adakunom wu a bi ra bafɛ́ amatse ishɔt. &lt;&lt;Tun aduk anet yɔng fɛ́ a se nate yin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 5:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s">Bafi ikuus bi tses ne bafidang <optbreak /> na atu ishɔt awo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ke akak yin bi kudaam ne afidang, iyet ikyɛng nsum na a tse ni kukun e ashon bafi nhwyi aza bafi ikuus awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Ke iyin rēn yin fok bafi ikuus ba fɛ̀ ba bi ra kazatse ishɔt awɛ? Ki iyin ba i bi ra yin kazatse ishɔt, i da ira yin ishɔt naban ndaam awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Ke iyin rēn yin fok, iyit ba in bi ra yit batomaza ishɔt awɛ? Wat na anɛ fi nkyɔrɔk kutset kang da ki gaat yit ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Nek anɔng, ki kuri ndaam yɔng bɛ́, i da tse yin ne ashon banet fɛ́ da ba se ni irèn ikuus awo yɛ? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />In cɛɛt anɔng, nek nsum ki yit yin. A sot vit atsitsɛng akak ayɛt yin fɛ́ a da kyem a nɔ nate bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba bɛ́ kudaam ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Aza anɔng, na afi ikuus a yo tse ni kukun aya, na ba nyeseng ashon bafi nhwyi!<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Atsak e yet, nkun fi i mi nɔɔs yin na bafidang, mi tonong kurat yin hwyiri-hwyiri. I kyem ishan inɛn e kyɛk awɛ, i kyem i won ba da mɔɔt kyɛk awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Awɛt iyin ba, iras yin anyas ni mɔɔt yin bafidang, bayɔng fi i ka ba nyes yin anɔng e yet bafi ikuus.<verse eid="1CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Iyin rēn yin fok bafɛ́ anyas bi kyem ba ya itekari igwɔm Adakunom awɛ? Akak bi ki wɔrɔk yin awo: Vit afi kujang, kɛ afi iya nabannom ntong, kɛ afi irɔs, kɛ amatek fɛ́ a yet inyak agwɔm, ke inye-izining fɛ́ ba kɔs ngma, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />kɛ akpatang, kɛ afi kuhwye, kɛ afi isɔs kutsit, kɛ afi itok, kɛ afi imɔɔt ayi, fɛ́ a bi ya itekari igwɔm Adakunom. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Bakak yin kin se anɔng, awɛt ba mi ki kusu yin, ba mi ki te yin cɛ́l, ba mi ki nɔk yin kusot kutek ni iyerek aTisa yit aYeso Kristi, ni irèn Kabik Adakunom yit.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Teng yik-yik ni nggɔn iras kujang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />&lt;&lt;In da kyem in ra akaakyɛ.&gt;&gt; Awɛt kaakyɛ di ki bɛ́ ni ibarang awo. &lt;&lt;In da kyem in ra akaakyɛ.&gt;&gt; Awɛt in da sot asam akaakyɛ awo.<verse eid="1CO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Ba tɛ ba fɛ̀ fok, &lt;&lt;Ba nye nayak nek kafa, nɛ kafa nek nayak.&gt;&gt; Awɛt ngma nkyɔrɔk nfa me, Adakunom bi gang ni ina. Da ba nye kurɔm nek iras kujang awo, tit ba nye iko nek aTisa, aTisa se nek kurɔm. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Ni kukyem wu Adakunom donong aTisa ni ifaben, anɔng wu a bi ki donong yit bà. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Ke iyin rēn yin fok, nrɔm yin yet nkap Anet-Isheshek ice wu awɛ? Wat in da sok nkap Anet-Isheshek, ni in moon ni inyak agwɔm ɛ? Ye kye awey yo! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" />Ke iyin rēn yin fok, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a moon kurɔm ni inyak agwɔm, ba mi sot kurɔm kuzining ni wu awɛ? Nek i se ni jɛk ye, &lt;&lt;Bafaa me da sot kurɔm kuzining.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a moon ice wu ne aTisa, ba mi sot ikyɛng izining na abik.<verse eid="1CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Kana kam yin yik-yik ni kujang. Ngma isherep anɛn fɛ́ anet ras, anet ras ina amatse kurɔm wu, awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a ras kujang, a beseng kurɔm wu. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" />Ke iyin rēn yin fok, kurɔm yin yet karɔ fɛ́ Kabik aJɛrɛ di sosok ni yin, fi i sɛ yin ne Adakunom awɛ? Iyin bɛ́ yin ice yin awo, <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />nek ba kin ki shan yin, ni itarang. Nek anɔng, nesek yin Adakunom iratek ni nrɔm yin.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s">Nrisim fɛ́ ba ras naton Kuweneng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Yɔkɔnɔng, in shim in cɛɛt azaton nkyɔrɔk fi i nye yin ku rip na: Ey, i se gyat anet bi ra abining awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />Awɛt nek ikɔk irɔm, won kaakyɛ anet na a bɛ́ abining wu, kaakyɛ abining na a bɛ́ amatek wu. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Won amatek e na ra kutomong iweneng sak na abining wu, won abining e na a nye anɔng sak na amatek wu bà. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Kurɔm abining e yet ku fuu aziwu awo, ku yet kufɛ́ amatek wu bà. Kpaf anɔng bà, kurɔm amatek e yet ku fuu aziwu awo, ku yet kufɛ́ abining wu bà. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />I bi ro yin ace yin ne awo, tit ni kushim yin ngma, in fi kizen gyet, nɔng i da bin nabak yin ace yin na awon. Ama anɔng, ni ti ni ya yin kashon kɔn aShetan bi ki mara yin nek avit itekap kurɔm yin. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Kucɛɛt ku kang fi in da fɛ́rɛ́ng yet itabak kyɛk, da ku yet ntsi awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />A di se ke ngma banet se ti imi. Awɛt kaakyɛ anet bɛ̀ kuri kunang fɛ́ Adakunom ku nɔɔk, azining bɛ̀ ku ka, nɛ akak bɛ̀ kuri me kuya.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Sak na bayɔng fɛ́ da ba mi ra kuweneng awo nɛ bakuma, in di i da se yɛɛt na ba sot anɔng dang kuweneng ti imi. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Awɛt ke da ba da kyem ba tekap ace bá awo, i se yɛɛt na ba ra kuweneng. Idung se yɛɛt na ba ra kuweneng da ikɔk ishim irɔm ni ka ba sɔ ice.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />Sak ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi ra kuweneng kong, in tsin ki nɔɔk yin ntsi, da imi awo, tit aTisa, ye, abining bi ka na kam ne amatek wu awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Awɛt ke a nye nɔng, a bi ra kuweneng awo, ke anɔng awo, won na nosong ashi na amatek wu. Anɔng bà, amatek bi ka na kam ne abining wu awo.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Sak ni ishɛrɛp e, imi fɛ̀ ni yin, da aTisa awo, ye, ke aruneng akak bɔ abining fɛ́ da a yet afi ikuus awo, abining e shim a sot gung ni wu, a bi ka na kam ni wu awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Ke abining akak bɛ̀ amatek fɛ́ da a yet afi inɔɔk atsak awo, amatek e shim a sot gung ni wu a bi ka na kam ni wu awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Nɔng amatek fɛ́ da a yet afi ikuus e awo na sot cɛ́l nek kusot bá kuzining ne abining wu, na abining fɛ́ da a yet afi ikuus e awo na sot cɛ́l bà nek kusot bá kuzining ne amatek. Ke da anɔng awo, ke nnon bá sot ikyɛng iraye, awɛt yɔkɔnɔng ba se jɛrɛ.<verse eid="1CO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Awɛt ke anet fɛ́ a yet afi ikuus e awo, shim ba ka na kam ne afi ikuus e, won na ba nye anɔng e. Nek ki i se anɔng, amatek e kɛ abining afi ikuus e ayi, se ni irosom ni irēn fɛ́ a di sɛ ice wu awo, nek Adakunom ki shim yit ni kusot kukyang na banet. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />Abining, ngɔn rēn gyan i da kyem isheshek amatek ngɔn ɛ? Ngɔn amatek, ngɔn rēn gyan i da kyem isheshek abining ngɔn ɛ?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuri kusot fɛ́ aTisa aYeso shim na ba nye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Won kaangan ayɛt yin na ya kashon ni isot narɔ fɛ́ aTisa aYeso shim na sot, na ma di nak azɔng ni izen fɛ́ Adakunom ku yes a sot afi ikuus. Ntsi me dɔng fi in nesek kaakyɛ sak na bafi ikuus ngma. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom ku yes, fɛ́ ba tsang ku ya katse, a bi tsɛt i sot tɛ ayɔng fɛ́ da ba ku ya katse awo. Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ Adakunom ku yes, fɛ́ da ba mi ku ya katse awo, a bi tsɛt fok na ba ku ya katse awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Ke na ba da ya katse, kɛ na ba da ya katse awo ayi, i agbat e me yet, na ba tot ntsi Adakunom gyat.<verse eid="1CO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Won kaangan na sot narɔ fɛ́ a tsang di se ni izen fɛ́ Adakunom ku yes. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />I tsang yet asam ni izen fɛ́ ba da yes ɛ? Idɔng bi da sot kudaam awo. Ki i bɛ̀ kawat i sot washak, ni nye anɔng. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a tsang yet asam ni izen fɛ́ aTisa ku yes, aTisa mi ku sak yɔkɔnɔng a sot washak. Anɔng bà, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a se washak ni izen fɛ́ aTisa ku yes, a mi sot asam Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Adakunom mi ki shan yin, a tarang, nek anɔng, i bi sot yin basam banet awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Ábaruneng, won kaangan na di nak narɔ fɛ́ a tsang di se ni izen fɛ́ Adakunom ku yes, won na di nak ni sot ifidang wu ne Adakunom.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nrisim naton bayɔng fɛ́ da ba bɛ̀ kuweneng awo nɛ bakuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Yɔkɔnɔng naton irip yin naton bayɔng fɛ́ da ba bɛ̀ kuweneng awo: Da in bɛ̀ agbat ifɛ̀ ikyɛng narɔ Adakunom awo, awɛt in tsin nɔɔk kuyiring hom kyɛk tɛ anet fɛ́ ba bi ite iyɛ ni wu nek itek aTisa. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Nek mgbang fi nse yɔkɔnɔng, in di i se yɛɛt anet na sot anɔng. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Ngɔn bɛ̀ kuweneng ɛ? I bi tsɛt i ka na kam yin awo. Ngɔn se dang kuweneng ɛ? I bi tsɛt kuweneng awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Awɛt ke i mi tsang ra kuweneng, da i yet inɛn awo, ke kanamang ra kuweneng, da i yet inɛn awo. Awɛt ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi nweneng, fos kurɔm makiyi ayɛt kusot iweneng, nek anɔng wu fi in shim in da bɔ awɛt kɔn mgbang e.<verse eid="1CO 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Ábaruneng, ikyɛng fi in cɛɛt yet, izen ti kyɛk dot awo. Azeng sak ashon, won bayɔng fɛ́ ba bi nweneng, na ba sot ti ba bi nweneng awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />Won bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ne kafa kawɛy, na ba sot tɛ ba bɛ̀ kafa kawɛy awo, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba se ni ifeng, na ba sot tɛ ba bi ifeng awo, nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba shashang ni res nkyɔrɔk, na ba sot ti nkyɔrɔk e yet nfuu bá awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />Bayɔng fɛ́ ba ra kutomong ni nkyɔrɔk azatse kang, ba bi te iyɛ bá ni ide awo, nek nse kazatse me kang yet in fi igot.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />In shim ni won yin kudaam. Anet fɛ́ da a mi ra kuweneng awo, kudaam wu yet na a ra ikyɛng fɛ́ aTisa shim, ngma anyɛk wu me yet na a tɛrɛk aTisa me iyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Awɛt anet fɛ́ a mi ra kuweneng, kudaam wu yet ndaam nkyɔrɔk azatse kang, nek na a tɛrɛk abining wu iyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />Nek anɔng nhwyɛ wu kaba asa faa. Abining fɛ́ da a mi ra kuweneng awo, kɛ kanamang, kudaam wu yet na a ra ikyɛng fɛ́ aTisa shim. Kuyiring wu yet na nabak ice wu ngma sak na aTisa, ayɛt irɔm nɛ kabik. Awɛt abin iweneng, kudaam wu yet nkyɔrɔk azatse me nang, ni irèn fɛ́ a da tɛrɛk amatek wu iyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />In ki tas yin nkyɔrɔk nang nɔng in ki sɛ yin mo, da nek in shim in ki daam yin awo, tit nek kusot yin bin se yɛɛt, ni ya yin aTisa ntong ni iyɛ izining, vit ikabasa nhwyɛ.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Ke anet fɛ́ a se ni kushi ne kanamang akak fɛ́ a se ni sam ka, fɛ́ ka mi kyem kuweneng, fɛ́ da ba mi tsang sak fok ba da ra kuweneng awo, awɛt a ne di fok a tsin ka ka nye ne ikyɛng fi i se yɛɛt awo, a tɛ foos ku kɔk ibɔ ka, won na nye anɔng, na ba ra kuweneng bá, da i yet inɛn awo. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Awɛt anet yɔng fɛ́ a nyeseng gak naton ikyɛng fi iyɛ wu sok, vit i te gbing-gbing ni wu, a tɛ rēn bereng ice wu gyat, a sok ayɛt iyɛ wu fok a da ku bɔ awo, anɔng e me se yɛɛt bà. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Nek anɔng, ayɔng fɛ́ a ra kuweneng anamang wu me a nye yɛɛt, awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a ra kuweneng e me awo, a dung nye yɛɛt.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Abin iweneng da kyem a kana kam ne amatek wu ni iwu rēn resek mo ni kutset awo. Awɛt ke amatek wu me a ku, a da kyem na bɔ akak fi iyɛ wu shim, tit na yet afi inyim aTisa. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Awɛt ni ku di hom, a da dung fok nta ke a di nak anɔng dang kuweneng. Ni ku di hom bà, in bɛ̀ Kabik Adakunom.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Nayak fɛ́ ba nabak nabannom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Yɔkɔnɔng, naton kucɛɛt nayak fɛ́ ba nabak inabak-akuce sak ne nabannom: Iyit rēn yin fok ngma yit in bɛ̀ yit irēn. Irēn bɛ́ ni kok ice, awɛt ishim bɛ́ ni inok. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a di fok iwu rēn ikyi ikak, idɔng tonong fok a rēn resek dang rēn ikyɛng fi i se yɛɛt na a rēn e. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Awɛt ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a shim Adakunom, Adakunom rēn ni iwu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Yɔkɔnɔng naton kucɛɛt iya nayak fɛ́ ba nabak inabak-akuce sak na nabannom e: Iyit rēn yit fok, na azatse ngma kusum, nabannom na yet ikyi ikak awo, in ti rēn yit fok Adakunom yet azining kyɛk, vit akak ama wu. <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Ngma ne fɛ́ bakak nye fok nabannom di se, kɛ nazanɛn kɛ na azatse ayi (na atsak e, &lt;&lt;nabannom&gt;&gt; e nɛ naban na &lt;&lt;atisa&gt;&gt; me, na di se dot), <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />ngma ne anɔng, iyit rēn yit fok, Adakunom yet azining kyɛk. Iwu wu a yet Ada fi nkyɔrɔk ngma ne ni wu, ni in se yit ni kusot nek iwu. In ti bɛ̀ yit aTisa azining kyɛk, iwu yet aYeso Kristi. I yet ni wu wu fi nkyɔrɔk ngma in ne, ni wu bà fi in di se yit ni kutset.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Awɛt da kaangan wu a rēn ne anɔng awo. Sak atut ana, banet bakak fɛ́ ba mi tsang di mɛɛ ni nggɔn ikuus nabannom, nizen fɛ́ ba ya kuri nayak e yɔng, na ba yiring fok ba mi tsang di nye inabak-akuce sak na nabannom e. Nek kuyiring bá rēn yet kufi nnon, ni i ka ba yet kudaam. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Awɛt nayak kyem na tse ni yit bakak ne Adakunom awo, na da ki kyɛk yit ikyikak ke na ki barang yit mo awo.<verse eid="1CO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ngma na anɔng, nye yin nhwyɛ kɔng ishim itonoso atsak yin bi sot kuta ikpas sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit agap awo. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Nek ke azining ayɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit agap da di ngɔn fi ibɛ irēn e ni tsin yas nitu iya nabannom ntong, ngɔn di, i da bang ka ba nɔk agap na ba kpa yas nayak fɛ́ ba nasap-akuce sak na nabannom awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Na anɔng, na aruneng agbɛrɛk yong fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek ku nek iwu, wat na beseng nek irēn ngɔn. <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Ki inyes yin barunyining anɛn anɔng, ni ka ba sas yin ndaam ayɛt áyɛ bá fɛ́ a se vit agap, aKristi wu fi i tsin ku ras yin inɛn. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Nek anɔng, ki ikyɛng fi in da ya, da sak aruneng na a kpa ni inɛn, i da tin ya inam awo, kɔng in bi ku sak na kpa.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Kukyem fɛ́ Atom aYeso bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />Imi bi irèn awɛ? Imi yet atom aYeso awɛ? Imi man di aYeso aTisa yit awɛ? Iyin yet yin ikyɛng fi kutomong hom ayɛt aTisa tes awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Ke da in yet atom aYeso na bakak awo, na atsak e in yet ni iyin! Nek iyin yet yin nagang-ice-igwɔm hom, ifi ira kutomong atom aTisa.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Itɛnɛng ice min ye fi in ras bayɔng fɛ́ sosok na ba di tsɛk ishɔt. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Iyit bɛ̀ yit irèn ni in ya ni isɔ yit awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Iyit bɛ̀ yit irèn in tseng yit na banyining yit fɛ ba se ni ikuus gung ni iyit tɛ batom bakak, tɛ aruneng aTisa nɛ aKefas di ras awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Kɛ a yet imi nɛ aBarnabas wu kyɛk fi i se gbing-gbing ni in ra yit kutomong iya ni ice yit ɛ?<verse eid="1CO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Angan atsom wu fɛ́ a ras kutomong, na ma tarasa ice wu yɛ? Akyɛ anet ikap ikɔ, na di tuus nakon anap, na won dang ya ica me yɛ? Angan anek ijaa fɛ́ a won dang sɔ nabasang e yɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />In tsin cɛɛt anɔng ni kuyiring anet awe kyɛk ɛ? In fɛ̀ kɛ Ntsi ice na fɛ̀ anɔng awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" />Nek i se ni jɛk ni kufumung ntsi aMusa fok yi, &lt;&lt;I bi faam inyak ikap kanu ni i tsin shushu nayak awo.&gt;&gt; A yet inyak de fɛ́ Adakunom daam naton de yɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />Atsak e yet fok fok a cɛɛt naton yit, kɛ anɔng awɛ? Ey, ba jɛk kucɛɛt kang nek iyit, nek ke anet ikap tsin kap nɛ anet ishushu nayak se ni ishushu me, ngma ba nye anɔng ayɛt ite iyɛ fok ba bi sɛ kuyak ni ishamang. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" />Ki iyit mi nye yit itus ijaa abik nate yin, i da se gyat ni in sɛ yit ikikak ifi irɔm ni yin awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Ke bakak bi irèn isɛs igbingding ni yin, i se gyat ki iyit ba in dung sɛ yit awɛ?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Awɛt ngma ne anɔng, iyit ra yit kutomong ni irèn fi in bɛ yit e awo, akuce anɔng, in nye yit akabɔk ne kaakyi kuri ikyɛng, kɔn in bi rosom yit ifɛ̀ itek Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" />Ke iyin rēn yin fok, bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras kutomong nitu iya Adakunom ntong, sɛs nayak bá azɔng awɛ? Nɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras kutomong narɔ kuta ashosh, sɛs kanu kafuu bá ayɛt nkyɔrɔk fɛ́ ba nasap azɔng awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" />Kpaf anɔng fɛ́ aTisa di fɛ́ fok bayɔng fɛ́ ba shara ifɛ̀ itek na ba sɛ iya ni isɔ bá azɔng.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Awɛt da imi ki mang ra kutomong ni irèn fi in bɛ̀ me awo. Da imi tsin ki jɛk yin nkyɔrɔk e nang ni ite iyɛ fok ni di nye yin ina awo. Kaduk ni in ku aza fɛ́ akak di ki kaba ni kukaa kang fi in bɛ̀. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />Ngma na anɔng, ki in se ni ishara ifɛ̀ itek, i da kyem in nye kukaa awo, nek i di yet agbing ni in shara. Kawɛy yet kanaan ki in ramin ishara ifɛ̀ itek! <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Ki in fi shara ni kushim in, ke ma ba di nɔk izang hom; awɛt nek ba di te mo gbing; in tsin ra kutomong fɛ́ ba di won e. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Wat akyɛ de i yet izang hom ɛ? Izang hom se ane: ayɛt ishara ifɛ̀ itek in, won ni in nesek ide ninang. Kɔn in bi ras kutomong ni irèn fi in bɛ̀ ayɛt ishara ifɛ̀ itek e awo.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Ngma ni kusot ice hom fi in se ne, in sas ice hom tɛ asam na akaangan, nek in sɛ in di kɔrɔk banet hwyɛt. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Sak ne baYahuda, in sot tɛ ibá, nek in di sɔ nhwyɛ bá. Sak ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba di kuus Ntsi, in sot tɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a di kuus Ntsi (ngma fi da imi di kuus Ntsi awo), nek in di kɔrɔk nhwyɛ bafi ntsi. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Sak ne bayɔng fɛ́ da ba bi ntsi awo, in sot tɛ ayɔng fɛ́ da a bi ntsi awo (ngma fi da imi se amatse ni ntsi Adakunom awo, imi kuus ntsi Anet-Isheshek), nek in di kɔrɔk nhwyɛ bá. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Sak ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit agap, in sot ti iba, nek in di sɔ nhwyɛ bá. Imi sot kaakyɛ sak ne banet ngma, nɔng na kaakyi irèn in di sheshek bakak. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />In nye ngma nkyɔrɔk yɔng, nek iya kashon ishara ifɛ̀ itek, nɔng in di sɛ kanu kanaan ayɛt awɛng e.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Iyin rēn yin fok ayɛt kuro itsi, ngma ba ba tumung i tsi me, awɛt anet azining wu kyɛk fɛ́ a sɛ kunang e awɛ? Nek anɔng, teng yin i tsi me ni irèn fi i di ki sɛ yin kunang e.<verse eid="1CO 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba da ka ba mara ni iro, ba te ice bá ntsi agap. Ba nye anɔng nek isɛ kunang fi da ku shɔɔm awo, awɛt iyit nye yit ifiit nek isɛs kunang fi ku shɔɔm ayɛ ne ayɛ. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />Nek anɔng imi teng i tsi hom tɛ anet fɛ́ a teng shaam awo; Imi kɔrɔng tɛ anet fɛ́ a tu kuwun awo. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Awɛy yo, in tsot kurɔm hom, in sak iko ku sot asam in, nɔng ama fi in mi shara sak na bakak, imi ice hom ba bi di ro ni isɛ izang awo.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Ikɔrɔk kuto ni nkyɛng-ashon ashon aIsrela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />Ábaruneng, yɔkɔnɔng, in shim ni irēn yin tsɛngtsɛng nkyɔrɔk yɔng fi in kin te, fɛ́ anɔk kin te gyip badakop yit, ba kin tat izɛk isɛng naton ntong nkoot. <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" />Izen fɛ́ ba se na anɔk e ni izɛk e, itonong fok, ba ka ba ra abatisma ngma, ba te bafi ikuus aMusa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Ngma ba ba kin ya kuyak abik, kuri kuzining e. <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" />Ba kin tɛ ba sɔ ashi abik, kuri kuzining e. Nek ba sɔ ashi fɛ́ a ne ni Kuta abik, fi ku tseng gung ni iba. Kuta me yɔng yet Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" />Ngma ne anɔng, Adakunom fok nta na bakak bá awo, nek anɔng a ka ba fɛɛs natse.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />Nkyɔrɔk nang kin te anɔng, nɔng in da bin sot ikyɛng imɛɛs ni yit, kɔng in bi bɛ̀ yit iyɛ ngash iras nkyɔrɔk imaan e ti iba kin di ra. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" />I bi ya yin nabannom ntong awo kyɔn tɛ bakak ba nye. Kyɔn ti i se ni jɛk ye, &lt;&lt;Banet e sosok, na ba ya, na ba sɔ, ama me, na ba ras kujang.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" />In bi ra yit kujang awo kyɔn tɛ bakak ba nye, fɛ́ banet agup nsɔk nfaa ina taat ba kus kunom kuzining. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" />In bi mara yit aKristi awo kyɔn tɛ bakak ba nye, fi i sak íhwyen kin ka ba fɛɛs mo. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" />I bi ngɔɔt yit nanu awo kyɔn tɛ bakak ba nye, fɛ́ atomaza iwɛs banet, ka ba fɛɛs mo.<verse eid="1CO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Nkyɔrɔk nang kin te anɔng, nɔng in da bin sot ikyɛng imɛɛs, ba kin te ni ijɛk nɔng ba bin di kɔrɔk yit mo kuto, iyit fi in se yit ni nnom igang azatse. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Nek anɔng, ki ngɔn di fok ngɔn mi nyeseng gak, won ni nye yɛɛt, kɔn i bi kpa! <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Vit imara ikak fi imang ki sɛ yin, fi da imang sɛ banet awo. Adakunom yet afi ishining ifɛ̀ wu, a da won imara ikak ni ki kpa yin fi i da waat agap yin awo. Awɛt izen fi imara me ki bɛ́ yin, a da ki nɔɔk yin agap inyeseng yin gak, na ki tarak yin irèn ihwyet.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Nek anɔng, iyin bacɛk iyɛ hom, sak yin ace yin yik-yik ni iya nabannom ntong. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />In tsin cɛɛt ni yin tɛ banet fɛ́ ba se tsɛngtsɛng, mara yin kucɛɛt hom ice yin, i da di yin. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" />Katsereng izɔɔn katek fi in di tonoso yit ifeng, ayet iwu wu fɛ́ a ki sak yit in sot yit ikyɛng izining ayɛt nasok aKristi awɛ? AKpam fi in bushung yit, ayet iwu wu fɛ́ a ki sak yit in sot yit ikyɛng izining ni irɔm Anet-Isheshek awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Nek akpam e yet azining, iyit fi in se yit dot, in yet yit kurɔm kuzining, nek ngma yit in ya yit ayɛt akpam azining e me.<verse eid="1CO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" />Yiring yin banet aIsrela. Bayɔng fɛ́ ba yas nayak inabak-akuce me, ba yet bayɔng fɛ́ ba ras kutomong ni kuta ashosh e awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Iyin di yin fok nyeng in cɛɛt fok, kuyak nabak-akuce fɛ́ ba nabak nabannom e, ina na na yet ikyi ikak ɛ? Kɛ nabannom e ka ka ka yet ikyi ikak ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" />Awey yo! Ikyɛng fi in cɛɛt yet fok, nnang ashosh fɛ́ bafi nhwyi nasap, ba nasap itséng e, da Adakunom awo. Da imi shim ni imoon yin ifidang ni itséng awo. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />I da kyɛm i sɔ yin na katsereng izɔɔn Adakunom ni ti ni sɔ yin na fi itséng bà awo. I da kyɛm ni ya yin ne atebul Adakunom ni ti ya yin na fi itséng bà awo. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" />Kɛ iyit shim in sak yit aTisa na fok ifup ɛ? Kɛ iyit di yit ti in ku wat yit na agap ɛ?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwashak bafi ikuus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />&lt;&lt;In bɛ̀ yit irēn ira kaakyi ikyɛng,&gt;&gt; awɛt da kaakyi ikyɛng e de fi i se gyat awo. &lt;&lt;In bɛ̀ yit irēn ira kaakyi ikyɛng,&gt;&gt; awɛt da kaakyi ikyɛng e de fi i bɛ́ ni iya kashon awo. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Da akak bi daam ni ice wu kyɛk awo, tit na a daam na bakak bà.<verse eid="1CO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Ya yin kaakyi kuri ikyɛng fɛ́ ba rɛs narɔ ijik inam, vit irisim, kɔng ayɛ yin bi se gak naton de. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" />Nek, &lt;&lt;Kazatse yet ka fɛ́ aTisa, ni nkyɔrɔk fin in se ayɛt e ngma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Ke afi nhwyi akak ki rini yin iya nayak, ki i shim i tse yin, ya yin ngma kuri ikyɛng fɛ́ ba ki nɔɔk yin vit nrisim, kɔng ayɛ yin bi se gak naton de. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Awɛt ke akak bɛ́ a ki tak yin fok ye, &lt;&lt;Ba mi tsang nabak nayak nang inabak-akuce sak na nabannom,&gt;&gt; i bi ya yin ina awo, nek i di sɛ ayɔng fɛ́ a da tak e, nek kuyiring iyɛ, <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />nek kuyiring iyɛ wu fi in di cɛɛt da kufɔɔn awo. Ke nyɛng akak da kyem a rip fok, &lt;&lt;Akyɛ sak fi kuyiring iyɛ akak da bi ízɔk naton hom ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ki in ya nayak e ni ifeng, akyɛ sak fɛ́ da wey ni mi naton ikyɛng fi in mi di nɔk Adakunom ifeng ɛ?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Nek anɔng, ngma ikyɛng fi i se yin ne, kɛ na ayet kuyak, kɛ i sɔ ayi, nye yin ide sak iratek Adakunom. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />I bi sak yin akak na kpa awo, kɛ na yet afɛ́ aYahuda, kɛ afɛ́ aGirik, kɛ afi ikuus Adakunom ayi. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Nye yin kyɔn ti imi di ras. In nye nyɛk ayɛt akaakyi ikyɛng itɛrɛk banet iyɛ, in tsɛsɛk itek ice hom awo, tit ifɛ́ bakak dot, nɔng ba bin sɛ isheshek.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />Mɛɛs yin ni imi, kyɔn ti imi mɛɛs na Anet-Isheshek.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itees naton iya ntong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />In ki tere yin ni kuyiring fi i nye yin naton in na akaakyɛ ikyɛng, ni ikuus nggɔn fi in ki nabak yin e.<verse eid="1CO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ama anɔng, in shim ni rēn yin fok, ice anet amatek yet Anet-Isheshek, ice abining yet amatek, ice Anet-Isheshek yet Adakunom. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Ngma anet amatek fɛ́ a ras awon kɛ a taas ibes ni ice wu ni hwyɛn, a byɛs akɔk-ashon wu. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Ngma abining fɛ́ a ras awon kɛ a taas ibes ni ice wu ni itarak, a byɛs akɔk-ashon wu, a se kpaf te abining fɛ́ akot na akwey ice wu. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Ke abining won dang hwyɛn ice wu, won na a sak ba ku akot ice me. Awɛt ki iyet ikyɛng nsum abining na a sak ba ku kot ice ke na ba kot ide ayi, won na hwyɛn ice wu. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" />I se gyat anet amatek na hwyɛn ice wu awo, nek iwu wu a yet nawu ni ízɔk Adakunom. Awɛt anet abining wu a yet ízɔk anet amatek. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" />Nek ba tun anet amatek ayɛt abining awo, tit abining wu a ne ayɛt anet amatek, <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />da ba nye anet amatek nek abining awo, tit abining nek anet amatek. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />Nek anɔng, i se gyat abining na hwyɛn ice wu, nɔng i bin tonong a se bɛɛt ni ice amatek nek batomaza.<verse eid="1CO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Ngma ne anɔng, ayɛt aTisa, anet abining se zɛɛt ne anet amatek awo, anet amatek se zɛɛt ne abining awo. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Nek kyɔn tɛ fɛ́ abining ne ayɛt anet amatek, anɔng wu fɛ́ anet amatek di ne ayɛt abining bà. Awɛt kaakyɛ ne na Adakunom. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Iyin yɛrɛk yin ice yin: i se gyat abining na a ra awon sak na Adakunom ni ice ni itarak ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Nggɔn kusot azatse ice ko ki tees yin fok ke anet amatek bɛ́ akwey ice asɔp, a yet ikyɛng nsum ni wu, <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />awɛt ke anet abining bɛ̀ akwey ice asɔp, a ku yet ikyɛng njik. Nek ba ku nɔɔk akwey ice asɔp, nek a kana hwyɛn mo. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Ke akak shim a kana kɔk ni kucɛɛt kang, iyit rēn yit nggɔn nkak awo, ngma ni itusung bafi ikuus Adakunom.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iya nayak aTisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Naton nkyɔrɔk na fi in fɛ́ ni nye yin, vit itere fi in da ki nye yin ne, nek itusung yin bang beseng nkyɔrɔk aza inye me. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Ni imɛsɛng e, in foos fok, ki i nyim yin tɛ bafi ikuus, i kana kabasa yin, in di ti in nɔɔk atsak ni kucɛɛt e. <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />Ey, i se gbing-gbing na ba sɛ ikaba nate yin, mok ba di rēn bangan wu kubɔk Adakunom se ni ba yɛ? <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Izen fi i kana tusung yin, a sot nayak aTisa wu fi i ya yin awo, <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />nek ni izen iyak e, kaangan a ya kashon ni kuyak wu vit itosok bafidang. Akak di wey ni nzong, na akak sɔ, na feng. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Iyin bɛ̀ yin nasa fi i di ki yas yin ni sɔs yin awɛ? Kɛ i shim ibyɛs yin bafi ikuus Adakunom, ni di tes yin bayɔng fɛ́ ba se vit ikyɛng nsum ɛ? Akyɛ fi in da ki tak yin ɛ? In ki tere yin nek ikyɛng fi iras yin ɛ? Ko ni kuro!<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Nek imi shan na aTisa ikyɛng fi in ki nɔɔk yin: ATisa aYeso, natuk e yɔng fɛ́ ba ku rɛp, a sok akpam e, <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />ama fɛ́ a mi di tonong ifeng, a bushung iwu, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Kurɔm hom kang, fɛ́ ba nɔɔk nek iyin; ras yin anɔng ni di yiring yin ni imi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" />Kpaf anɔng bà, ama kuyak e, a sok katsereng izɔɔn e, a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Kakereng isɔ yong yet kushi kufas fɛ́ ba nye na nasok hom; ras yin anɔng, ngma izen fi i tsin sɔ yin e, ni di yiring yin ni imi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Nek ngma izen fi i ya yin akpam e yong, i sɔ yin na katsereng isɔ yong, ni shara yin ifɛ̀ iku wu sak izen kubɛ́ wu.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iya nayak aTisa ni nggɔn arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />Nek anɔng, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya akpam me, kɛ a sɔ ayɛt aridɛ aTisa ayɛt irèn fi da i se gyat awo, a ra inɛn sak ni kurɔm nɛ nasok aTisa me. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Won anet na a tun maas ice wu ninyɛn, a da ne a ya akpam e, na ma sɔ ayɛt aridɛ me. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Nek ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a ya, a sɔ, vit iyiring fok kurɔm aTisa yɔng, a tsin ya na sɔ ishɔt ni ice wu yɔng. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Nek anɔng wu banet dot ayɛt yin di se gbɛrɛk, ni nrɔk, bakak yin mi di kus. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Awɛt ki in mas yit ace yit e gyam, in da kpa yit ni ishɔt awo. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Ke aTisa ki ras yit ishɔt, ba tsin ki tabak yit yɔng, kɔn ishɔt bi ki ya yit gung ne kazatse.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Nek anɔng, ábaruneng, izen fi i ka na tusung yin nek iya nayak aTisa, tosok yin bafidang. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Ke akak yin foos nzong, won na yas ari, nɔng izen fi i ka na tusung yin, itusung e bi ki kɔrɔk yin ishɔt awo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 11:34">Won ki in bɛ́, in bi ki tak yin ikyɛng ira.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Nnang Abik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Yɔkɔnɔng, ábaruneng, azaton nnang abik, imi shim ni i rēn yin. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Iyin rēn yin fok, ni izen fi i kin yet yin bafi nhwyi, ba kin sɔ ice yin, ba kin ki kɔrɔk yin atse sak ikuus nabannom fɛ́ da na cɛɛt awo. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Nek anɔng, in fɛ̀ ni yin fok, vit anet fɛ́ a cɛɛt ayɛt abik Adakunom fɛ́ a kyem a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Tang aYeso anyas.&gt;&gt; Vit ayɔng fɛ́ a da kyem a fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;AYeso yet aTisa,&gt;&gt; tit Kabik aJɛrɛ ka ku sɛ mo.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />Nnang abik di se zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt, awɛt Kabik kazining e ka ka nesek. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Ntomong ira di se zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt, awɛt ba ras sak na aTisa azining e. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Irèn iras ntomong se zizɛɛt, awɛt Adakunom azining e wu a nesek banet agap iras e ngma.<verse eid="1CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Kabik Adakunom e tonoso ice ka sak na kaangan, nek itek banet ngma. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Kabik e nɔɔk akak kutsitsɛng aBik, na Kabik kazining e nɔɔk akak kutsik irēn, <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />na Kabik kazining e nɔɔk akak kunang inesek atsak, na Kabik kazining e nɔɔk akak kunang ites banet kyang. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Na ka nɔɔk akak kukyem iras ntomong abes, na ka nɔɔk akak kukyem itaas ifɛ̀ Adakunom, na ka nɔɔk akak kukyem ikaas ndiri-ndiri nabik, na ka nɔɔk akak kukyem icɛɛt ayɛt alem zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt, na ka nɔɔk akak irēn tirisi alem e.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ilem; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nɛ ayet ibyat e ifɛ́ </char><char style="fv">28</char>.</note> <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Ngma nkyɔrɔk nang yet kutomong Kabik kazining e, iwu nesek kaangan kunang kpaf ti iwu di shim.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kurɔm kuzining ni nkap dot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />Kurɔm anet awe se burang, ngma ni nkap zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt fi ku bɛ̀; ne ngma nkap dot fi ku bɛ́, ngma nsot kurɔm kuzining. Anet-Isheshek yɔng a se anɔng. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Nek ngma yit ba kin ki ra yit abatisma ne<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Nɛ; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ke </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ayet.</char></note> Kabik kazining sak ni kurɔm kuzining, ke ni i yet baYahuda kɛ bafɛ́ aGirik ayi, ke asam kɛ nnon ari ayi, ngma ba kin ki nɔɔk yit Kabik kazining e in sɔ yit.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Fok yin, ba nye kurɔm na abak azining awo, tit nkap dot-dot. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Ki kutak fi ku fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Nek da imi yet kubɔk awo, vit ikyɛng fi i di moon ni kurɔm,&gt;&gt; kutak e da kyem ku tɛn ice ko ni kurɔm nek ikyɛng fi ku fɛ̀ awo. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Ki kuto fi ku fɛ̀, &lt;&lt;Nek da imi yet iyisi awo, vit ikyɛng fi i di moon kurɔm,&gt;&gt; Kuto me da tɛn ice ko ni kurɔm nek ikyɛng fi ku fɛ̀ awo. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Ki kurɔm kusum fi ku yet ayisi, ke anet e foos na akyɛ? Ki kurɔm kusum fi ku yet wɔn ato, ke anet foos nkɔn na akyɛ? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Awɛt Adakunom saas nkap irɔm, kaa kungan ko kpaf narɔ fi iwu shim. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Ke ngma nkap e fi in yet kukap kuzining kyɛk, ki kurɔm e se akyɛ? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Ti in da se, nkap dot-dot, awɛt kurɔm kuzining.<verse eid="1CO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Da iyisi da kyem i fɛ̀ ni kubɔk, &lt;&lt;Imi da shim awo!&gt;&gt; Kɛ ni ice fɛ̀ ni kutak, &lt;&lt;Imi da shim awo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />Akuce anɔng, nkap irɔm fi in se tɛ vit ina na agap, ina na ba kyem ba nye ikikak dang ina awo. <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />Nkap irɔm e fi in yɛrɛ yit kurat na, in nesek yit ina iratek gyet awo, nkap irɔm fɛ́ ba tonoso ina awo, ba berese ina gyatgyat awo, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />nyɔng fɛ́ ba tonoso tsɛt anɔng awo. Awɛt Adakunom moon nkap irɔm e, a nɔɔk iratek sak ni nyɔng fi in bɛ̀ kurat, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />kɔn ikaba bi se nate nkap irɔm e, tit kukap irɔm e kukaa gyerep kuyaa. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Ke abak akak tsin sɔ mgbang, ni ishɛrɛp nkap e sɔ mgbang gung ni iko; kɛ abak akak sɛ iratek, ni ishɛrɛp nkap e sɔ nta gung ni iko.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Yɔkɔnɔng iyin ba i yet yin kurɔm Anet-Isheshek, kaangan yin yet abak irɔm e. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" />Ayɛt itusung bafi ikuus, Adakunom tung kasa bakak ba sot batom aYeso, bafɛ́ afaa yet batan, bafɛ́ ataat yet bafi itees, nɛ bakak yet bafi ntomong abes, nɛ bakak yet bafi ites banet kyang, nɛ bakak yet bafi igbingding bakak, nɛ bakak yet bafi itonoso irèn itseng ni ntomong, nɛ bakak yet bafi icɛɛt ayɛt alem zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Banet ngma kusum yet batom ɛ? Banet ngma kusum yet batan ɛ? Banet ngma kusum yet bafi itees ɛ? Banet ngma kusum ras ntomong abes ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Banet ngma kusum bɛ̀ kunang ites banet kyang ɛ? Banet ngma cɛɛt ayɛt alem zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt ɛ?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ke: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Icɛn ikak.</char></note> Banet ngma tirisi kucɛɛt-abes ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Awɛt muu yin ice ayɛt itsɛsɛk nnang fi in wat.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Yɔkɔnɔng in da ki tonong yin irèn fi idung se gyat.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Ishim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Ki in fi in kyɛm in cɛɛt ni ilem banet nɛ bafɛ́ batomaza, awɛt vit imi ni ishim, in sot in se ti kutsɔm fi kuwɔng, kɛ tɛ ibing fi iwɔng kyɛk. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" />Ki in fi in bɛ̀ ngma nnang itaas abes, kɛ ngma irēn nkyɔrɔk inɛt, kɛ ngma irēn nkyɔrɔk ayi, kɛ i bi inɔɔk atsak fi i da kyem i serek ahwyanang, awɛt da in bi ishim awo, in sot ikyi ikak awo. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Ki in sok ngma ikyɛng fi in bɛ̀ in nɔɔk bakan, in ti nɔɔk kurɔm hom na ba shosh ni irong, awɛt vit imi ni ishim, in bi itek ikyi ikak awo.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Ishim bɛ̀ akabɔk ni nhwyɛ. Ishim bi ifup awo, i bi itsot kugwɔm kɛ icɛshɛk ice awo. <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />I bɛ́ kugbarak ice awo, i bɛ́ ishim ice awo, i bi namaan ziri awo, i bɛ́ tusung nkyɔrɔk imaan e ni iyɛ awo. <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />Ishim fok nta iras nkyɔrɔk nmaane awo, tit ifoos nta iras atsak. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Ishim bi te kawat ni izen mgbang awo, i bi nɔɔk atsak, i bi te iyɛ, i bi kabɔk na kaakyi ikyɛng.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Ishim bi igang awo. Awɛt itaas-ibes bi gang, ncɛɛt ni ilem zizɛɛt bi te yuu, irērēn nkyɔrɔk bi gosok. <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />Irēn yit mi shining awo, itaas ibes yit bà mi shining awo. <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />Awɛt izen fi ishining e i bi bɛ́, idɔng fi ishining e awo bi te bit. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Ni izen fi in yet nggon, in cɛɛt ti nggon, in yiring ti nggon, in tɔrɔng nkyɔrɔk ti nggon. Awɛt izen fi in sot anet, in wobok nggɔn kuri nfi nnon. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Nek yɔkɔnɔng in yɛrɛ yit nawu yit ni ikyɛng iyɛrɛ na se hwyi, awɛt atuk e yɔng in bi yɛrɛ yit ayisi na ayisi. Yɔkɔnɔng irēn hom mi ishining awo, awɛt atuk e yɔng in bi rēn wɛshɛk irēn fɛ́ Adakunom di rēn mo.<verse eid="1CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Yɔkɔnɔng nkyɔrɔk ntaat na in di ki nak; inɔɔk atsak, ni ite iyɛ, ni ishim, awɛt iyɔng fi idung waat yet ishim.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s">Nnang itak ibes ni icɛɛt ni ilem iduk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Nye yin nyɛk itsɛsɛk ishim ni iyɛ ngas nnang abik, imakmak e kunang itak ibes. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Nek anet fɛ́ a cɛɛt ni ilem iduk, a cɛɛt ne banet awo, tit a cɛɛt ne Adakunom wu. Nek vit anet fɛ́ a rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ a cɛɛt, nek a cɛɛt nkyɔrɔk yɔng fi i se ni nɛt ayɛt kukyem Kabik. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a taas ibes, a cɛɛt ne banet wu nek i ka ba gbinding, ni ka ba barang mo agap, ni nok imen iyɛ. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Anet yɔng fɛ́ a cɛɛt ni ilem iduk, a tsin ban nok ice wu wu, awɛt ayɔng fɛ́ a taas ibes, a tsin nok bafi ikuus ngma. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Imi shim kaangan na cɛɛt ni ilem iduk, awɛt in dung shim ki itaas yin ibes ningya. Ayɔng fɛ́ a taas ibes a nat ayɔng fɛ́ a cɛɛt ni ilem iduk, nek tit ma akak tirisi ifɛ̀ me ninyen, bafi ikuus da ne ba sɛ inok.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Di yin ábaruneng, ki in bɛ́ ni in ma cɛɛt ni yin ni ilem iduk, wat itek e yet akyɛ? Tit in ki bɛ́ yin ni itarak ice naton Adakunom, kɛ irēn, kɛ ibes, kɛ itees ikak ayi. <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Kyɔn ti nkyɔrɔk yɔng fin in bi kutset awo fi in wɔng, ti ihwyɛrɛ ni izom, ki ntɔ me wuruk yɛɛt awo, ne anɛ fɛ́ akak da kyem a rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ ba fɛsɛm kɛ ba tsot ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Nek ke da ba fɛɛp igba yɛɛt nɔng banet da rēn awo, angan da ka na nye nek itsom ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />I se kpaf anɔng ni yin. Ke icɛɛt yin ni ilem iduk fɛ́ vit akak fɛ́ a kyem a rēn, ne anɛ fɛ́ akak da kyem a rēn ikyɛng fi icɛɛt yin ɛ? I sot icɛɛt yin ni wun kyɛk.<verse eid="1CO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Icɛ́n di se zizɛɛt-zizɛɛt na azatse kang, kaakyi icɛn ba kyem ba rēn ikyɛng fi icɛɛt. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Nek ki da in kyem in rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ akak se ni cɛɛt e awo, i sot in sot atsen sak ni iwu yɔng, iwu tɛ a sot atsen sak ni imi bà. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />I se kpaf anɔng ni yin. Kyɔn tɛ fi i bɛ̀ yin iyɛ ngash itsɛt yin nnang abik, nye yin nyɛk itsɛsɛk yin nnang abik fi in wat, fi in da bɛ́s ni inok bafi ikuus.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Nek anɔng, ngma ayɔng fɛ́ a cɛɛt ni ilem iduk, na ra awon na ba ku nɔɔk kunang tirisi me. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Nek ki in ra awon ni ilem iduk, i yet kabik hom ka ka tsin ra awon e, awɛt kuyiring hom sɛ ikyi ikak awo. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Nek anɔng akyɛ yet ikyɛng a ra yɛ? In da ra awon ne kabik hom, awɛt ngma ne kuyiring hom bà. In da ra abom na kabik hom, awɛt ngma ne kuyiring hom bà. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Nek ki ngɔn feng Adakunom ne kabik ngɔn kyɛk, ne anɛ fɛ́ ayɔng fɛ́ a se nate yin fɛ́ da a rēn ilem iduk e da shiwu ye, &lt;&lt;Anɔng&gt;&gt; ni ifeng fi i se ne, fi iwu rēn ikyi ikak naton e awo yɛ? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Awon ifeng ngɔn sak ne Adakunom e se yɛɛt akabes, awɛt ayɔng e sɛ ibarang ikyi ikak awo.<verse eid="1CO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />In tere Adakunom nek in kyem in cɛɛt ni ilem iduk aza kaangan yin. <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />Awɛt ngma ne anɔng ni itusung bafi ikuus, in wat shim in tak itin ifɛ̀ itoon fi in da tees bakak, azaton itak itin ifɛ̀ agup kusok ni ilem iduk.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Ábaruneng, i bi ya yin kashon ni kuyiring ti nnon awo. Sot yin ti nnon na kabak anyas, awɛt won kuyiring yin ni kusot tɛ anet ako. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" />I se ni Kufumung Adakunom fok, &lt;&lt;ATisa fɛ̀, &lt;In bi cɛɛt ne banet hom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">ni irén bafi ilem iduk,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">in bi tin cɛɛt ni ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">ni ilem batsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">ngma ne anɔng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">da ba di fok awo.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Nek anɔng, kucɛɛt ni ilem iduk yet ikyɛng idi nek bafi ikuus awo, tit bayɔng fɛ́ da ba yet bafi ikuus awo. Awɛt itak ibes, yet nek bafi ikuus, da nek bayɔng fɛ́ da ba yet bafi ikuus awo. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Nek anɔng, ke ngma bafi ikuus ka na tusung ngma kusum, na kaangan tsin cɛɛt ni ilem iduk, nɛ bakak fɛ́ da ba rēn ikyɛng fɛ́ ba se ne awo, kɛ bayɔng fɛ́ da ba yet bafi ikuus awo nɔ, iyin di yin, ba da fɛ̀ iririm yin awɛ? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Awɛt ke afi nhwyi ke ayɔng fɛ́ a shim a rēn ayi nɔ a ki sɛ yin na kaangan tsin taas ibes, a da di kurat wu, ni ishɔt ku mes naton ikyɛng fɛ́ a fok, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />ba tsin taas ikyɛng fɛ́ a mi nɛt ni iyɛ, na anɔng wu a da men pak ayisi aben, na nye, &lt;&lt;Na tsak e, Adakunom se nate yin!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iya ntong ni irèn fi i se yɛɛt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />Ábaruneng, akyɛ fi in da fɛ̀ kong ɛ? Izen fi i nyim yin, won akak yin na ra abom, akak itees, akak itak ikyɛng fɛ́ Adakunom ku tonong e, akak icɛɛt ni ilem iduk, akak tirisi me. Won nkyɔrɔk nang ngma ni sot nek inok bafi ikuus ngma. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Ke akak da cɛɛt ni ilem iduk, won da ba bi nat banet bafaa kɛ bataat awo, na ba cɛɛt bazizining, na akak na tirisi. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Ke vit anet itirisi me, won anet icɛɛt ni ilem iduk e me na te yuu ayɛt i nyim bá me. Won na cɛɛt ni ice wu nɛ Adakunom wu kyɛk.<verse eid="1CO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Won banet bafaa kɛ bataat na ba tak ibes, na bakak ba mara ikyɛng fɛ́ ba taas. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Awɛt ke Adakunom tonong akak fɛ́ a se ni sonong ikyi ikak, won ayɔng fɛ́ a tsin cɛɛt e na nyeseng ninyen. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Ngma yin i da kyem i tak yin ibes bazizining, na kaangan sɛ itees ni ibarang agap. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Kabik inang ibes se ni bɔk batan. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Nek Adakunom da a yet Adakunom iras nkyɔrɔk kpɛɛ awo, tit ayɛt kusonong kukyang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Ti i se ni tusung bafɛ́ ajɛrɛ ngma, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />won banyining na ba sot yuu ni tusung bafi ikuus. Nek da ba ka ba nang kawat cɛɛt awo, tit na ba nabak ice, kyɔn ti i di se ni jɛk ni fumung Ntsi. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Ke ba shim ba rip ikyi ikak, won na ba risim batek ari bá na nasa bá. Nek i yet ikyɛng nsum abining na cɛɛt ayɛt itusung bafi ikuus.<verse eid="1CO 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Ni ice yin wu fi ifɛ̀ Adakunom di tumung ɛ? Kɛ nkum ni yin kyɛk fi ifɛ̀ me ta yɛ? <verse eid="1CO 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Ke akak di fok iwu yet atan, kɛ a bɛ̀ kunang abik, won na a rēn fok, ikyɛng deng fi in tsin ki jɛk yin e yet agbat ifɛ̀ aTisa. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Awɛt ke akak a rawu dang tot agbat ifɛ̀ me deng, iwu ma ba bi ku rawu bà.<verse eid="1CO 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Nek anɔng, ábaruneng hom, bɛ̀ yin iyɛ ngas itak ibes, i bi ro yin ne ni cɛɛt ni ilem iduk awo. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Tit na ba nye kaakyi ikyɛng ni irèn fi i se kpaf, i tseng yɛɛt.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s">Idorok Anet-Isheshek ni iku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Yɔkɔnɔng, ábaruneng, won in ki yiring yin ne ni ifɛ̀ itek fi in kin ki shara yin e, iyɔng fi ishan yin, ibereng yin ikuus ye gak. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />I yet nek ifɛ̀ itek e deng de fɛ́ ba da ki sheshek yin, ki ibereng yin gak ifɛ̀ fi in ki shara yin e me. Kɛ da anɔng awo, inɔɔk atsak yin isot abap.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />Nek ikyɛng fi in shan, ide de fi in ki nɔɔk yin, nek in wat kaakyi itek, fok, Anet-Isheshek ku nek anɛn yin, i se anɔng ni jɛk ni fumung Adakunom, <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" />ye ba ku nɛt ni rɛk, ba ku donong ni kunom kufɛ́ taat, kyɔn tɛ kufumung Adakunom fɛ̀, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" />a ma tonong ice wu sak na aKefas, ngma ni kusɔk abe afaa me bà. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Ama anɔng, a tonong ice wu sak ne bafi ikuus anakat atoon ni izen izining. Dot ayɛt ba se ni kutset yɔkɔnɔng, ngma ne anɔng bakak ba mi kus. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />A ma tonong ice wu sak na aYakubu, ama me kong sak ne batom ngma, <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" />Ama me ngma, a ma tonong ice wu sak ni imi, imi fi in se tɛ nggon fɛ́ ba tes izen dang nye.<verse eid="1CO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" />Nek imi wu in yet a wosong ayɛt batom e, da in kyem na ba di yes atom ngma awo, nek in zoot bafi ikuus Adakunom. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Awɛt nek itek Adakunom wu fi i sak in yet ikyɛng fi in yet, itek wu sak ni imi se na abap awo. I sak, in ra kutomong ne agap in wat batom e ngma, da imi wu in di ra kutomong e awo, tit itek Adakunom e yɔng fi i se ayɛt hom. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Nek anɔng, ke na yet imi fi in tsin shara ifɛ̀ itek e me yɛ kɛ iba ayi, ikyɛng e de fi in shara yit ngma, i yet ni na fi i di nɔɔk yin atsak.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idoro nkom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Ke yɔkɔnɔng fi in shara ifɛ̀ ye ba donong Anet-Isheshek ni iku, akyɛ sak fɛ́ bakak ayɛt yin nye fok vit idoro bafaben ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Ke vit idoro bafaben, idɔng tonong fok ba mi donong Anet-Isheshek ni iku awo. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Ke da ba mi donong Anet-Isheshek ni iku awo, ki ishara ifɛ̀ yit sot abap, ki inɔɔk atsak yin i sot abap bà. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Ki i sot in nɔɔk yit kanu mbɔɔs naton Adakunom, nek in fɛ̀ yit fok Adakunom donong Anet-Isheshek ni iku. Awɛt ki i yet atsak, vit idoro bafaben, ki i sot Adakunom donong Anet-Isheshek ni iku awo. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />I fi iyet fok vit idoro bafaben, ki i sot ba mi donong Anet-Isheshek ni iku awo. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Ke da ba donong Anet-Isheshek ni iku awo, ki inɔɔk atsak yin i sot abap, ki irēn resek yin ayɛt anɛn yin. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />I ti sot bayɔng fɛ́ ba kus ayɛt Anet-Isheshek mi wey. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ki ite iyɛ yit na Anet-Isheshek fi i yet nek kutset yɔkɔnɔng kyɛk, ki in sot yit ikyɛng angmishish in wat yit ishɛrɛp banet ngma.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Awɛt atsak e yet, ba mi donong Anet-Isheshek ni iku, anɔng e tonong tsɛngtsɛng fok ba bi donong bayɔng fɛ́ ba man kus bà, ti icá akon imɛsɛng e. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Kyɔn ti fi iku ne na anet awe, anɔng bà idoro bafaben ne na anet awe. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Kyɔn tɛ ngma iku ne nek Adamu, kpaf anɔng bà ba bi donong ngma nkom nek Anet-Isheshek. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Awɛt kaangan bi dorok ni izen wu; Anet-Isheshek yet afi imɛsɛng e, wat ama me, izen fɛ́ a bi bɛ́, ngma bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet bafuu bi ku kuus mo. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" />Ama me kong ki igang e bɛ́, ama fɛ́ Anet-Isheshek mi wey ne naban-abik, nɛ bágwɔm nɛ bafi ice, na ma nabak Adakunom Ada igwɔm e.<verse eid="1CO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" />Nek i se gbing-gbing Anet-Isheshek na a ya igwɔm, sak ni izen fɛ́ Adakunom sak bafi ifa ni wu, ba sot aben atak wu. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Afi ifa igang e fɛ́ ba da wey ni ye yet iku. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" />Kyɔn ti i se ni fumung Adakunom ye, &lt;&lt;Adakunom te kaakyi ikyɛng na aben atak wu.&gt;&gt; Di yin, ke ba fɛ̀ fok, &lt;&lt;Kaakyi ikyɛng&gt;&gt; nawop wu, idɔng tonong fok Adakunom se ayɛt e awo, nek a yet iwu wu fɛ́ a te kaakyi ikyɛng e nawop Anet-Isheshek me. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Ama fɛ́ Adakunom mi sak kaakyi ikyɛng nawop wu. Arim me ice wu da sak ice wu nawop Adakunom, ayɔng fɛ́ a sak kaakyi ikyɛng nawop wu, nɔng Adakunom bin ya igwɔm naton nkyɔrɔk ngma.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Ki i fi yet fok vit idoro bafaben, akyɛ yet ikyɛng i sɛ sak na bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba ra abatisma azaton bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi tsang kus ɛ? Ki i yet atsak fok vit idoro bafaben, akyɛ sak ba ra banet abatisma azaton bayɔng fɛ́ ba mi kus e yɛ? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Awɛt iyit, akyɛ sak fi in da te yit ice yit nanu kawɛy kaakyi izen ɛ? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />Ábaruneng, in yɛrɛ iku kaakyɛ kunom. In fɛ̀ anɔng na katsak e, nek in tsot kugwɔm ni iyin, nek imoon yin ifidang ne Anet-Isheshek aYeso aTisa yit. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" />Ki in kɔn ni inyam ayit na Afisa nek kuyiring anet awe, akyɛ da yet izang hom, ki vit idoro bafaben ɛ? Ke anɔng,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:32">&lt;&lt;Won ni in ya yit ni in sɔ yit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:32">nek katson in da kus yit.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">AIshaya 22:13</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1CO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Won ba bi ki wɔrɔk yin awo. &lt;&lt;Kusot ne banet baduk beseng nggɔn ntek.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Bun yin ni nhwyɛ yin, da wosong yin iras inɛn. Nek bakak ayɛt yin da ba rēn Adakunom awo. In fɛrɛng anɔng nɔng i da bin fok yin nsum.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuri kurɔm fɛ́ ba bi doro ni iko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Awɛt akak da kyem a nye irip fok, &lt;&lt;Ba bi donong nkom anɛ? Akyɛ kuri nrɔm ko fɛ́ ba bi nes ɛ?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />Kushɔp! Ikyɛng fi itup, kyem i tang awo, tit i ku ninyen. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Ikyɛng fi itup iye ija kyɛk, da ngma kurɔm e yɔng fi ku da rasak ama me awo, ke na yet ica alikama kɛ ica ikyi ikak zɛɛt ayi. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Awɛt Adakunom nesek ica me nrɔm fi iwu shim, kaakyi ica ni kuri kurɔm fi ku se kpaf ni iye. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Inam ngma da i yet kuri kuzining e awo. Nfɛ́ banet awe se zɛɛt, nfi inyam se zɛɛt, nfi nanon se zɛɛt, nfi ìzos se zɛɛt bà. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Nkyɔrɔk azanɛn di se, nkyɔrɔk azatse di se bà. Awɛt kusas nkyɔrɔk azanɛn se zɛɛt, kusas nkyɔrɔk azatse se zɛɛt bà. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Kusas kunom se zɛɛt, kusas kufen se zɛɛt, ni kusas ádat se zɛɛt bà. Àdat akak sas zɛɛt aza akak.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />I se kpaf anɔng ni idoro bafaben. Kurɔm fɛ́ ba nɛt iko aben ti ija ku bush, ba donong iko vit ibush. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Ba tup iko ayɛt kurat, awɛt ba donong iko ayɛt ízɔk. Ba tup iko ayɛt avit agap, awɛt ba donong iko ayɛt agap. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Ba tup iko ayɛt kurɔm anet awe, awɛt ba donong iko ayɛt kurɔm abik.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 15:44">Ke kurɔm anet awe di se, idɔng tonong fok, kurɔm abik di se bà. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" />I se anɔng ni kufumung Adakunom ye, &lt;&lt;Anet afi imɛsɛng e, Adamu, a sot ikyɛng itsɛt.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Imɛsɛng 2:7</ref></char>.</note> Awɛt Adamu afi igang e, a yet Kabik fɛ́ ka nesek kutset. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Ikyɛng fi i tun ne yet kurɔm, kabik da nɛ ka di kuus ama. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Ba nye Adamu afi imɛsɛng e ni ntong azatse, awɛt afɛ́ faa me ne azanɛn. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Banet fɛ́ ba yet bafɛ́ azatse ba se kpaf tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ka ba nye ni nse anet awe. Awɛt bayɔng fɛ́ ba yet bafɛ́ azanɛn, ba se kpaf tɛ bayɔng fɛ́ ba ne azanɛn. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Kyɔn ti fi in di se yit yɔkɔnɔng ayɛt nse anet awe, atuk kakak in bi se yit ayɛt nse bafɛ́ azanɛn.<verse eid="1CO 15:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Ábaruneng, in tsin ki tak yin fok, kurɔm nɛ nasok da kyem inɔ ni igwɔm Adakunom awo, kɛ kurɔm fi ku bush ni ku ya itekari kurɔm fi da ku bush awo. <verse eid="1CO 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />Fok yin, in tsin ki tak yin atsak e fi i se ni nɛt ye: Da ngma yit fi in da kus yit awo, awɛt ngma yit ba bi shesheng nse yit, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />ta izining, tɛ i te kparam ayisi, ni i fɛp igba ifi igang e. Nek ba bi fɛp igba, na ba donong nkom ni kuri nrɔm fi da na bush awo, na ba shesheng nse nrɔm yit. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Nek i se gbing-gbing na ba shesheng kurɔm kang fi ku bush sak ni kuyɔng fi ku bush awo, na ba tɛ ba shesheng kurɔm kang fi iku ni kuyɔng fi da ku ku awo. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" />Izen fɛ́ ba shesheng kurɔm e kang fi ku bush ni kuyɔng fi da ku bush awo, ba tɛ ba shesheng kurɔm e kang fi ku ku ni kuyɔng fi da ku ku me awo, ni izen e me yɔng fi ifɛ̀ dɔng fi i se ni jɛk da shining ye, &lt;&lt;Ba mi ngɔnɔng iku, ba mi ya awɛng naton iku.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">AIshaya 25:8</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />&lt;&lt;Wo iku! Iya awɛng ngɔn e akɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 15:55">Wo iku! Agap imaan banet ngɔn e akɛ?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ban di yin: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HOS 13:14">AHosiya 13:14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Iku sɛ agap imaan banet ni inɛn, inɛn kong i sɛ agap ye ni Ntsi <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Awɛt ifeng sak na Adakunom, iwu fɛ́ a ki nesek yit awɛng ayɛt aTisa aYeso Kristi.<verse eid="1CO 15:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Nek anɔng, ábaruneng hom, nyeseng yin gak, da ikyi ikak bi ki te digit yin awo. Nɔk yin ace yin ngma kaakyi izen ni ra kutomong aTisa, nek i rēn yin fok kutomong yin sak na aTisa yet kufɛ́ abap awo.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s">Inesek kunang nek banet Adakunom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />Yɔkɔnɔng, naton ifɛ̀ itusung kunang nek banet Adakunom ne aRushelima, nye yin kpaf ikyɛng fi in fɛ̀ ne bafi ikuus aGalati na ba nye. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Ayɛt akaakyɛ kunom imɛsɛng ni imoon nnom, won kaangan ayɛt yin na tusung itsɔm kpaf ni isɛ wu, na ma sak iye gyat, nɔng izen fi in bi bɛ́, ba bi ne ba kpa itusung itsɔm e awo. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Nɔng ama fi in bi in ta, in bi jɛk kufumung itonong ice ni in nɔɔk bayɔng fi iyin mi kasa yin, nɔng na ba bin tse ni kunang yin e sak ne aRushelima. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Ki iyin di yin fok i se yɛɛt ni imi ni tse bà, ba bi di tsaa.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">ABulus ka na nye nek kutseet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />In bi ki bɛ́ yin itsen, ama fi in mi tse na aMasedoniya, nek in mi tsang sak i tse na aMasedoniya. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Gyan in da sot ni yin nfi ki izen gyeet, kɛ ngma izen abolosh ayi, nɔng ami ma me, i di ki te yin ni irèn ni ku tsɛɛt hom, kaakɛ fi in da tse. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Da in shim in ki di yin nfi ki izen gyeet kyɛk awo, tit in shim ni in nye nkɔs nfaa ni yin, ke Adakunom shim. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" />Awɛt in da sot ne Afisa sak ni izen aTuk aPɛntɛkɔs. <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" />Nek ba mi di tarak katitu gbey kafi ira kutomong kutek azeng, ngma ne anɔng, banet dot se ni icuna ni imi.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />Di yin fok, ke aTimoti bɛ́ ni yin, ku sak yin na a sot washak nate yin, nek a yet afi kutomong Adakunom kpaf ti imi. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Nek anɔng, akak bi ku byɛs awo, ku te yin ni irèn na tik kyang ni izen ku bun wu sak ni imi, nek in tsin di te iyisi ku bɛ́ wu gung ne baruneng yit bakak bafi ikuus.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Naton aruneng yit Apolos, in mi sɔ ni cɛɛt ni wu, na bɛ́ azɔng ni yin gung ni ishɛrɛp baruneng bafi ikuus, awɛt iyɛ wu sok awo. A bi bɛ́ kyɛk ni izen fi i se yɛɛt. <verse eid="1CO 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />Kana nye yin yɛɛt, nyeseng yin gak ayɛt inɔɔk atsak yin, sot yin ni iyɛ ting, na agap bà. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Won ngma ikyɛng fi i da ra yin, ni ra yin ide ayɛt ishim.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />Irēn yin ne bafɛ́ ari aIstifanus fɛ́ ba yet bafi imɛsɛng ishan atsak ne Akaya. Ba nɔk ice bá ni kutomong igbingding bafi ikuus. In ra won ni yin ye, <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />fok yin kuri ifɛ̀ banet bang, ngma ne bayɔng fɛ́ ba moon ice, ni nye nyɛk ira kutomong kuri kuyɔng. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />In nye kafa kakan makiyi, izen fɛ́ ba aIstifanus, nɛ aFartunatus, nɛ Akikus bɛ́ ba ta. Nek iwat i di se ti iyin bang azeng ni imi. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Ba di tɛrɛk iyɛ, ni iyin bá. Kuri banet tɛ bayɔng, i se yɛɛt na ba ka ba nɔk iratek.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ashow afi igang e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />Bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba se ni mben Asiya ki nye yin ashow. Akwila nɛ aPrisila, ngma ne bafi ikuus fɛ́ ba nyis ari bá, ki nye yin ashow yɛɛt-yɛɛt ni iyerek aTisa. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Ngma baruneng fɛ́ ba se azeng ba ki nye yin ashow. Te show yin bafidang ni irèn fi i tonong ishim yin yɛɛt-yɛɛt.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />Imi aBulus, in tsin jɛk kufumung ashow kang ni kubɔk hom.<verse eid="1CO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Ngma ayɔng fɛ́ da a shim aTisa awo, won kawɛy na ka se ni ice wu. ATisa yit, bɛ́!<verse eid="1CO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Won itek aTisa aYeso ni sot gung ni yin.<verse eid="1CO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Ishim hom sak ni yin ngma ayɛt Anet-Isheshek aYeso.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>